{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261027-887d2a", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "三つ目の読みとして、空の挟みの内外が数える手で入れ替わる断片を返す。問いは閉じない。", "relation_id": "REL-20261027-55c70e", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-20261108-b3e2fc", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261027-887d2a", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "間隔に連続を置く第一編に対し、空の挟みの内外を版ごとに不定とする。", "relation_id": "REL-20261027-1d877e", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261108-dcb98d", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261109-2ed2c7", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "名は同じで曲がりが違う田と、数えるたび内外が変わる空の挟み。同一とずれの二層。", "relation_id": "REL-20261027-5d7a66", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261027-887d2a", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261027-887d2a", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "消えた男の帽子が残る話を、帽子も残らない空の挟みへ反転。", "relation_id": "REL-20261027-32dcf4", "relation_type": "metaphorically_resonates", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-341", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "left": {"id": "Q-20261027-e332ba", "type": "question"}, "note": "列の一部か外かという置き所を、参加か辞退かという二分へ組まず、第三の置き方として開く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261027-499818", "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"id": "Q-20261108-b3e2fc", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "left": {"id": "Q-20261027-995f7b", "type": "question"}, "note": "「列の一部か外か」の置き所の問いを、番号を振る手の交代と「同一／別」の問いへ延ばす。", "relation_id": "REL-20261027-ead669", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-20261108-b3e2fc", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-27", "left": {"id": "Q-20261027-9f7ed1", "type": "question"}, "note": "記憶を持たない次の当番と、継続として残る／消えるものを、忘却と沈黙の糸へ繋ぐ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261027-449787", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MOTIF-006", "type": "motif"}}
